OnRemoveCollateralCallbackTest
├── given caller market is not supported
│   └── it should revert
└── given caller market is supported
    ├── when swap fails
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when swap succeeds but amountOut is less than minAmountOut
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when swap succeeds and amountOut meets minAmountOut
        ├── when there are no leftover sell tokens
        │   ├── when amountOut is less than user borrowed assets
        │   │   └── it should repay specified amount
        │   └── when amountOut is greater than user borrowed assets
        │       └── it should repay full user debt and transfer excess to onBehalf
        └── when there are leftover sell tokens
            ├── when amountOut is less than user borrowed assets
            │   └── it should transfer leftover tokens to onBehalf and repay specified amount
            └── when amountOut is greater than user borrowed assets
                └── it should transfer leftover tokens to onBehalf repay full debt and transfer excess 